After injecting the payload scan the whole stack for the payload bytes, 
because they can be in several unexpected places where you can have more MEMORY!!!!!!!!

Check injected payload in whole stack

1)!teb
example:
StackBase    0x01720000 
StackLimit   0x0171e000

2) search payload bytes in stack range

s -b StackLimit StackBase <bytes>
example:
s -b 0x0171e000 0x01720000 0x43 0x43 0x43 0x43 --> search for CCCC

